{"about_the_game":"&quot;Everyone called it 'The Yellow,' but its origins were a mystery. <br>Nobody cared much about it at first. It took some time for the changes to be noticeable on the users, but then it was too late. <br>No organization, no government, not even a war against it could stop its spread.&quot;<br><br>At 4 AM, join Aila as she starts her attempt at freedom.<br><br>Step into the near-future dystopian world of '4 AM,' an immersive side-scrolling adventure. <br>Embark on a perilous journey where survival means hiding, running, and clever problem-solving. <br>Are you prepared to make the tough choices required for your escape? <br>Just remember, every action you take has consequences.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/9dd891f5c91f06cf0bd42433025e657c.avif?t=1736521964\" width=616 height=97 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/85ecf062b7b6f5e3fb0259e05bacec0d.poster.avif?t=1736521964\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/85ecf062b7b6f5e3fb0259e05bacec0d.webm?t=1736521964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/85ecf062b7b6f5e3fb0259e05bacec0d.mp4?t=1736521964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/3192abf1af28568de1963275ae15d345.avif?t=1736521964\" width=616 height=97 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/1aeb2862c78506d5eccb500775245c00.poster.avi